### Listar todos os arquivos do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/files?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Filtrar arquivos por lead
GET {{base_url}}/api/files?lead_id={{lead_id}}&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Filtrar arquivos por tipo
GET {{base_url}}/api/files?tipo=imagem&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Filtrar arquivos por período
GET {{base_url}}/api/files?from=2026-04-01&to=2026-04-05&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Buscar por nome
GET {{base_url}}/api/files?search=contrato&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Download de arquivo
GET {{base_url}}/api/files/{{file_id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
